Five services and three teams

`Gateway` calls `Search`, `Cart` and `Profile`. `Cart` calls `Pricing`. Team
`Edge` owns `Gateway`. Team `Shop` owns `Cart` and `Pricing`. Team `People` owns
`Search` and `Profile`. Use the key `owner`.
---
Gateway -> Search, Cart, Profile
Cart -> Pricing
Gateway { owner: Edge }
Cart, Pricing { owner: Shop }
Search, Profile { owner: People }
